      "trackName": "Doudizhu-watch game",
      "description": "Doudizhu — Classic Card Game on Your Wrist\n\nPlay the classic Chinese card game Doudizhu on your iPhone and wrist device. Enjoy Laizi wild-card mode and multiple AI difficulty levels. Scores sync with Game Center so you can climb the rankings.\n\n• Classic mode is free to play\n• Laizi wild-card mode and Hard AI (Premium)\n• Game Center leaderboards for Classic and Laizi\n• Consistent experience across iPhone and wrist device\n\nSUBSCRIPTION INFORMATION\n\nAnnual Subscription (auto-renewing)\n• Subscription period: 1 year\n• Price: the current price is shown on the purchase screen in your local currency\n• Payment is charged to your Apple ID account when you confirm the purchase\n• The subscription renews automatically unless auto-renewal is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period\n• You can manage or cancel your subscription in iPhone Settings > Apple ID > Subscriptions\n\nLifetime Unlock (one-time purchase)\n• One payment unlocks Premium permanently; it does not renew or expire\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://gamepark.online/doudizhu/privacy\nTerms of Use (EULA): https://gamepark.online/doudizhu/terms",
